<title>USA: Advanced Tissue to submit Dermagraft PMA.</title>
<headline>Advanced Tissue to submit Dermagraft PMA.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Tissue Sciences Inc said Monday it plans to submit a Premarket Approval (PMA) application to the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for Dermagraft for the treatment of diabetic foot ulcers in December of this year.</p>
<p>The company said a study of Dermagraft study showed statistical significance for the treatment and said it has held discussions with the FDA.</p>
<p>Advanced Tissue Sciences has agreed to form a joint venture with Smith &amp; Nephew Plc for the worldwide commercialization of Dermagraft in April of this year.</p>
</text>
